 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Read for the practical details",
     "texto": [
      "Routine messages state their purpose in the first line. Look for **names**, **dates**, **times** and what the reader has to **do**.\n\n- Date: **el sábado 18**; **del 18 al 20 de julio**.\n- Time: **a las siete y media**; **a las siete**.\n- Condition: **antes del 10 de julio**.\n\nA confirmation says what is booked, but sometimes does not explain every cancellation condition: look for a separate policy if the text mentions one. The texts in this lesson are invented examples."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Dates, times and conditions",
     "texto": [
      "For dates and times:\n\n- **el sábado 18**, **el 18 de julio**, **del 18 al 20 de julio**.\n- **a las siete**, **a las siete y media**, **a las siete menos cinco**.\n- **antes del 10 de julio** marks the last day to act.\n\nA formal confirmation uses **nosotros**: **Confirmamos** la reserva. And asks for something with **usted**: **Responda** a este correo.\n\nA personal message uses **tú**: **Mándame** un mensaje, **te espero** dentro."
     ],
